1
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:16,320
You said forever by the kitchen door

2
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:16,560
You said forever by the kitchen door

3
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:19,730
Rain on your sleeve, your keys beside the bowl

4
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:22,990
I kept the sentence folded in my coat

5
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:26,070
Like something small I couldn't let go

6
00:00:26,720 --> 00:00:29,800
Now every quiet room leans your way

7
00:00:30,270 --> 00:00:34,060
I tell myself the warmth will fade

8
00:00:34,635 --> 00:00:37,450
아직 네 온기가 남아

9
00:00:37,920 --> 00:00:40,700
가슴 한쪽에 머물러

10
00:00:41,065 --> 00:00:43,470
우린 끝이라 말했는데

11
00:00:43,520 --> 00:00:46,140
왜 난 아직 너를 기다려

12
00:00:47,370 --> 00:00:49,800
The cup you left is chipped along the rim

13
00:00:50,670 --> 00:00:52,990
I turn it round, then set it where it's been

14
00:00:53,290 --> 00:00:56,280
Some days I almost make it through the hall

15
00:00:56,690 --> 00:00:59,680
Then hear your laugh inside an empty wall

16
00:00:59,730 --> 00:01:02,860
I don't call, I don't ask you to return

17
00:01:02,910 --> 00:01:07,340
I just keep the little heat I couldn't burn

18
00:01:13,585 --> 00:01:16,380
아직 네 온기가 남아

19
00:01:16,845 --> 00:01:19,630
가슴 한쪽에 머물러

20
00:01:19,985 --> 00:01:22,400
우린 끝이라 말했는데

21
00:01:22,450 --> 00:01:25,060
왜 난 아직 너를 기다려

22
00:01:38,483 --> 00:01:41,710
Maybe forever was a word for that one night

23
00:01:41,763 --> 00:01:44,930
Not a promise we could carry into morning light

24
00:01:44,983 --> 00:01:47,523
Still, when the winter settles in my chest

25
00:01:48,583 --> 00:01:51,043
Your name is where the silence rests

26
00:01:52,523 --> 00:01:55,363
아직 네 온기가 남아

27
00:01:56,172 --> 00:01:58,440
천천히 식어 가도

28
00:01:59,095 --> 00:02:01,290
우린 끝이라 말했는데

29
00:02:01,340 --> 00:02:05,000
내 마음은 아직 그곳에

30
00:02:05,390 --> 00:02:08,070
The cup stays by the sink

31
00:02:08,660 --> 00:02:11,360
The room gets on with its day

32
00:02:12,420 --> 00:02:14,720
I keep the warmth a little longer

33
00:02:16,130 --> 00:02:17,220
Then let it be
